<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-829] bin/mahout doesn&apos;t match the way the packaged forms of Mahout are arranged</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-829</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;bin/mahout assumes that conf is in $MAHOUT_HOME/src/conf if MAHOUT_CONF_DIR isn&apos;t set.  In the packaged version of Mahout, however, it is in $MAHOUT_HOME/conf.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is easy to handle with a couple of if&apos;s.  Patch incoming.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
